  <h3>Limitations</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      Predictions indicate estimated risk and do not guarantee
      a student's final academic outcome.
    </li>
    <li>
      Model performance depends on the quality and representativeness
      of the data used for training and evaluation.
    </li>
    <li>
      Evaluation metrics describe performance on the relevant
      dataset and may not generalize to every student population.
    </li>
  </ul>
